Our approach
- Brand Concierge is Adobe's platform for conversational experiences on your website, mobile apps and other digital properties. Every conversation is grounded in your own content and guardrails.

What we would do
- For Cedar Prairie Mutual Insurance Company, we will set up the Brand Concierge experience for the agreed insurance products:
  - connect and curate the approved content sources;
  - design the conversations and guardrails for the agreed questions;
  - configure the brand voice and the required disclosures;
  - set up the handoff (live chat, meeting booking or both) routed to your designated team;
  - build, with your reviewers, the golden-answer test set (including the priority discovery questions from the Brand Visibility program) and the refusal and escalation scenarios;
  - complete Adobe's pre-go-live checks;
  - launch on the agreed pages in stages.

What we would need from you
- You supply the approved content, current product facts, reviewers and the handoff destination; compliance decisions stay with you.
- The handoff is live chat or meeting booking through Adobe Marketo Qualifier (formerly Sales Qualifier), which needs the representatives added as users in the Adobe Admin Console and at least one representative with a connected calendar (for meeting booking) or set live chat availability (for live chat).
- Live chat conversations are kept for 30 days, so you confirm your own record-keeping needs.
